eeting ran from nine to eleven, two hours in total."}]}, {"id": 17, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "电脑", "pinyin": "diànnǎo", "english": "computer", "khmer": "កុំព្យូទ័រ", "breakdown": "电(electric)+脑(brain)", "ex_cn": "我用电脑学习。", "ex_py": "Wǒ yòng diànnǎo xuéxí.", "ex_en": "I use a computer to study.", "chars": ["电", "脑"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我用电脑学习。", "py": "Wǒ yòng diànnǎo xuéxí.", "en": "I use a computer to study."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "这台电脑很贵。", "py": "Zhè tái diànnǎo hěn guì.", "en": "This computer is expensive."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我的电脑坏了。", "py": "Wǒ de diànnǎo huài le.", "en": "My computer is broken."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "现在的孩子从小就会用电脑。", "py": "Xiànzài de háizi cóngxiǎo jiù huì yòng diànnǎo.", "en": "Nowadays children know how to use computers from a young age."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "我把电脑修好以后，工作效率高多了。", "py": "Wǒ bǎ diànnǎo xiūhǎo yǐhòu, gōngzuò xiàolǜ gāo duō le.", "en": "After I got my computer fixed, my work efficiency improved a lot."}]}, {"id": 18, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "电视", "pinyin": "diànshì", "english": "TV", "khmer": "ទូរទស្សន៍", "breakdown": "电(electric)+视(vision)", "ex_cn": "他在看电视。", "ex_py": "Tā zài kàn diànshì.", "ex_en": "He is watching TV.", "chars": ["电", "视"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他在看电视。", "py": "Tā zài kàn diànshì.", "en": "He is watching TV."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我家有一台电视。", "py": "Wǒ jiā yǒu yì tái diànshì.", "en": "My family has a TV."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "请把电视关了。", "py": "Qǐng bǎ diànshì guān le.", "en": "Please turn off the TV."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "晚饭以后，我们一家人常常一起看电视。", "py": "Wǎnfàn yǐhòu, wǒmen yì jiā rén chángcháng yìqǐ kàn diànshì.", "en": "After dinner, our family often watches TV together."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "与其看电视，不如出去运动一下。", "py": "Yǔqí kàn diànshì, bùrú chūqù yùndòng yíxià.", "en": "Rather than watch TV, it's better to go out and exercise a bit."}]}, {"id": 19, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "电影", "pinyin": "diànyǐng", "english": "movie", "khmer