 "对我来说，家是最温暖的地方。", "py": "Duì wǒ láishuō, jiā shì zuì wēnnuǎn de dìfang.", "en": "For me, home is the warmest place."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "无论多晚，他都坚持回家吃晚饭。", "py": "Wúlùn duō wǎn, tā dōu jiānchí huí jiā chī wǎnfàn.", "en": "No matter how late, he insists on going home for dinner."}]}, {"id": 46, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "叫", "pinyin": "jiào", "english": "to be called / to call", "khmer": "ត្រូវហៅថា", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "我叫小明。", "ex_py": "Wǒ jiào Xiǎomíng.", "ex_en": "My name is Xiaoming.", "chars": ["叫"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我叫小明。", "py": "Wǒ jiào Xiǎomíng.", "en": "My name is Xiaoming."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你叫什么名字？", "py": "Nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?", "en": "What's your name?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "请你叫他一下。", "py": "Qǐng nǐ jiào tā yíxià.", "en": "Please call him for me."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "大家都叫他老王，虽然他还不到三十岁。", "py": "Dàjiā dōu jiào tā Lǎo Wáng, suīrán tā hái bú dào sānshí suì.", "en": "Everyone calls him \"Old Wang,\" even though he's not even thirty yet."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "老师叫我们明天把作业交上来。", "py": "Lǎoshī jiào wǒmen míngtiān bǎ zuòyè jiāo shànglai.", "en": "The teacher told us to hand in our homework tomorrow."}]}, {"id": 47, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "今天", "pinyin": "jīntiān", "english": "today", "khmer": "ថ្ងៃនេះ", "breakdown": "今(present)+天(day)", "ex_cn": "今天天气很好。", "ex_py": "Jīntiān tiānqì hěn hǎo.", "ex_en": "The weather is good today.", "chars": ["今", "天"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "今天天气很好。", "py": "Jīntiān tiānqì hěn hǎo.", "en": "The weather is good today."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "今天是星期一。", "py": "Jīntiān shì xīngqīyī.", "en": "Today is Monday."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你今天忙吗？", "py": "Nǐ jīntiān máng ma?", "en": "Are you busy today?"}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "今天的会议比预计的时间长了一个小时。", "py": "Jīntiān de huìyì bǐ yùjì de shíjiān chángle yí ge xiǎoshí.", "en": "Today's meeting ran an hour longer than expected."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "能今天完成的事，就不要留到明天。", "py": "Néng jīntiān wánchéng d