定我能不能毕业。", "py": "Míngtiān de kǎoshì huì juédìng wǒ néng bu néng bìyè.", "en": "Tomorrow's exam will determine whether I can graduate."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "要是明天天气好，我们就去爬山。", "py": "Yàoshi míngtiān tiānqì hǎo, wǒmen jiù qù páshān.", "en": "If the weather is good tomorrow, we'll go hiking."}]}, {"id": 71, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "名字", "pinyin": "míngzi", "english": "name", "khmer": "ឈ្មោះ", "breakdown": "名(name)+字(character/word)", "ex_cn": "你叫什么名字？", "ex_py": "Nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?", "ex_en": "What is your name?", "chars": ["名", "字"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你叫什么名字？", "py": "Nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?", "en": "What is your name?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我的名字是李明。", "py": "Wǒ de míngzi shì Lǐ Míng.", "en": "My name is Li Ming."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "请写下你的名字。", "py": "Qǐng xiěxià nǐ de míngzi.", "en": "Please write down your name."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这个孩子的名字是爷爷起的。", "py": "Zhège háizi de míngzi shì yéye qǐ de.", "en": "This child's name was chosen by his grandfather."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "我一时想不起来他的名字了。", "py": "Wǒ yìshí xiǎng bu qǐlai tā de míngzi le.", "en": "I couldn't recall his name for a moment."}]}, {"id": 72, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "哪", "pinyin": "nǎ", "english": "which", "khmer": "ណា", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "你要哪个？", "ex_py": "Nǐ yào nǎge?", "ex_en": "Which one do you want?", "chars": ["哪"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你要哪个？", "py": "Nǐ yào nǎge?", "en": "Which one do you want?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "哪个是你的书包？", "py": "Nǎge shì nǐ de shūbāo?", "en": "Which one is your backpack?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你喜欢哪种颜色？", "py": "Nǐ xǐhuan nǎ zhǒng yánsè?", "en": "Which color do you like?"}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "我不知道该选哪一个工作机会。", "py": "Wǒ bù zhīdào gāi xuǎn nǎ yí ge gōngzuò jīhuì.", "en": "I don't know which job opportunity to choose."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这几个方案里，哪一个最适合我们公司？", "py": "Zhè jǐ ge fāng'àn lǐ, nǎ yí ge zuì shìhé wǒmen gōngsī?", "en": "Among these plans, which one suits our company best?"}]}, {"id": 73, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "哪儿", "pinyin": "nǎr", "english": "where", "khmer": "កន្លែងណា", "breakdown": "哪(which)+儿(suffix)", "ex_cn": "你去哪儿？", "ex_py": "Nǐ qù nǎr?", "ex_en": "Where are you going?", "chars": ["哪", "儿"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你去哪儿？", "py": "Nǐ qù nǎr?", "en": "Where are you going?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "洗手间在哪儿？", "py": "Xǐshǒujiān zài nǎr?", "en": "Where is the restroom?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你住在哪儿？", "py": "Nǐ zhù zài nǎr?", "en": "Where do you live?"}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "我实在想不起来把钥匙放在哪儿了。", "py": "Wǒ shízài xiǎng bu qǐlai bǎ yàoshi fàng zài nǎr le.", "en": "I really can't remember where I put my keys."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "不管去哪儿旅行，他都喜欢带着相机。", "py": "Bùguǎn qù nǎr lǚxíng, tā dōu xǐhuan dàizhe xiàngjī.", "en": "No matter where he travels, he likes to bring a camera."}]}, {"id": 74, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "那", "pinyin": "nà", "english": "that", "khmer": "នោះ", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "那是我的书。", "ex_py": "Nà shì wǒ de shū.", "ex_en": "That is my book.", "chars": ["那"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "那是我的书。", "py": "Nà shì wǒ de shū.", "en": "That is my book."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "那个人是谁？", "py": "Nàge rén shì shéi?", "en": "Who is that person?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "那件衣服很漂亮。", "py": "Nà jiàn yīfu hěn piàoliang.", "en": "That piece of clothing is pretty."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "那次旅行是我这辈子最难忘的经历。", "py": "Nà cì lǚxíng shì wǒ zhè bèizi zuì nánwàng de jīnglì.", "en": "That trip was the most unforgettable experience of my life."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "那份工作虽然辛苦，却让他学到了很多。", "py": "Nà fèn gōngzuò suīrán xīnkǔ, què ràng tā xuédàole hěn duō.", "en": "That job, though tiring, taught him a lot."}]}, {"id": 75, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "呢", "pinyin": "ne", "english": "(question particle, 'what about')", "khmer": "(ភាគទីសួរបន្ត)", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "我很好，你呢？", "ex_py": "Wǒ hěn hǎo, nǐ ne?", "ex_en": "I'm good, what about you?", "chars": ["呢"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我很好，你呢？", "py": "Wǒ hěn hǎo, nǐ ne?", "en": "I'm good, what about you?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我的手机呢？", "py": "Wǒ de shǒujī ne?", "en": "Where's my phone?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他还在开会呢。", "py": "Tā hái zài kāihuì ne.", "en": "He's still in a meeting."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "别担心，孩子们正在客厅里玩呢。", "py": "Bié dānxīn, háizimen zhèngzài kètīng lǐ wán ne.", "en": "Don't worry, the kids are playing in the living room."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "要是你不去，那我呢，还要一个人去吗？", "py": "Yàoshi nǐ bú qù, nà wǒ ne, hái yào yí ge rén qù ma?", "en": "If you're not going, then what about me, do I still have to go alone?"}]}, {"id": 76, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "能", "pinyin": "néng", "english": "can / be able to", "khmer": "អាច", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "我能帮你。", "ex_py": "Wǒ néng bāng nǐ.", "ex_en": "I can help you.", "chars": ["能"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我能帮你。", "py": "Wǒ néng bāng nǐ.", "en": "I can help you."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你能来吗？", "py": "Nǐ néng lái ma?", "en": "Can you come?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "明天我不能去。", "py": "Míngtiān wǒ bù néng qù.", "en": "I can't go tomorrow."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "只要坚持锻炼，身体就能慢慢变好。", "py": "Zhǐyào jiānchí duànliàn, shēntǐ jiù néng mànmàn biàn hǎo.", "en": "As long as you keep exercising, your health can gradually improve."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这个方法能不能解决问题，还需要试一试。", "py": "Zhège fāngfǎ néng bu néng jiějué wèntí, hái xūyào shì yi shì.", "en": "Whether this method can solve the problem still needs to be tried."}]}, {"id": 77, "level": "HSK1", "chinese": "你", "pinyin": "nǐ", "english": "you", "khmer": "អ្នក", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "你好！", "ex_py": "Nǐ hǎo!", "ex_en": "Hello!", "chars": ["你"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你好！", "py": "Nǐ hǎo!", "en": "Hello!"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "你是谁？", "py": "Nǐ shì shéi?", "en": "Who are you?"}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我喜欢你。", "py": "Wǒ xǐhuan nǐ.", "en": "I like you."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "要是没有你的支持，我不可能坚持到现在。", "py": "Yàoshi méiyǒu