ence."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他花了很长时间才改掉这个坏习惯。", "py": "Tā huāle hěn cháng shíjiān cái gǎidiào zhège huài xíguàn.", "en": "It took him a long time to break this bad habit."}]}, {"id": 284, "level": "HSK2", "chinese": "笑", "pinyin": "xiào", "english": "laugh / smile", "khmer": "សើច / ញញឹម", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "她笑了。", "ex_py": "Tā xiào le.", "ex_en": "She smiled.", "chars": ["笑"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "她笑了。", "py": "Tā xiào le.", "en": "She smiled."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "别笑我。", "py": "Bié xiào wǒ.", "en": "Don't laugh at me."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他笑得很开心。", "py": "Tā xiào de hěn kāixīn.", "en": "He laughed happily."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这个笑话把大家都逗笑了。", "py": "Zhège xiàohua bǎ dàjiā dōu dòuxiào le.", "en": "This joke made everyone laugh."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "无论遇到什么困难，她总是笑着面对。", "py": "Wúlùn yùdào shénme kùnnan, tā zǒngshì xiàozhe miànduì.", "en": "No matter what difficulties she faces, she always faces them with a smile."}]}, {"id": 285, "level": "HSK2", "chinese": "新", "pinyin": "xīn", "english": "new", "khmer": "ថ្មី", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "我买了新手机。", "ex_py": "Wǒ mǎile xīn shǒujī.", "ex_en": "I bought a new phone.", "chars": ["新"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我买了新手机。", "py": "Wǒ mǎile xīn shǒujī.", "en": "I bought a new phone."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "这是我的新家。", "py": "Zhè shì wǒ de xīn jiā.", "en": "This is my new home."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他穿了新衣服。", "py": "Tā chuānle xīn yīfu.", "en": "He wore new clothes."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "公司最近开发了一款新产品，反响很好。", "py": "Gōngsī zuìjìn kāifāle yì kuǎn xīn chǎnpǐn, fǎnxiǎng hěn hǎo.", "en": "The company recently developed a new product with a good reception."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "搬到新城市以后，他花了一段时间才适应。", "py": "Bāndào xīn chéngshì yǐhòu, tā huāle yíduàn shíjiān cái shìyìng.", "en": "After moving to a new city, it took him a while to adapt."}]}, {"id": 286, "level": "HSK2", "chinese": "姓", "pinyin": "xìng", "english": "surname / family name", "khmer":