e missed."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这家餐厅主打家常菜，深受附近居民的喜爱。", "py": "Zhè jiā cāntīng zhǔdǎ jiāchángcài, shēn shòu fùjìn jūmín de xǐ'ài.", "en": "This restaurant specializes in home-style dishes and is well loved by nearby residents."}]}, {"id": 326, "level": "L11", "chinese": "西红柿", "pinyin": "xīhóngshì", "english": "tomato", "khmer": "ប៉េងប៉ោះ", "breakdown": "西(west)+红(red)+柿(persimmon) - old folk name", "ex_cn": "我喜欢吃西红柿炒鸡蛋。", "ex_py": "Wǒ xǐhuan chī xīhóngshì chǎo jīdàn.", "ex_en": "I like eating tomato with scrambled eggs.", "chars": ["西", "红", "柿"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我喜欢吃西红柿炒鸡蛋。", "py": "Wǒ xǐhuan chī xīhóngshì chǎo jīdàn.", "en": "I like eating tomato with scrambled eggs."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "西红柿是红色的。", "py": "Xīhóngshì shì hóngsè de.", "en": "Tomatoes are red."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "这个西红柿很甜。", "py": "Zhège xīhóngshì hěn tián.", "en": "This tomato is sweet."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "西红柿炒鸡蛋是最简单也最受欢迎的家常菜之一。", "py": "Xīhóngshì chǎo jīdàn shì zuì jiǎndān yě zuì shòu huānyíng de jiāchángcài zhī yī.", "en": "Tomato and scrambled eggs is one of the simplest and most popular home-style dishes."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "挑选西红柿的时候，要选颜色均匀、比较硬的。", "py": "Tiāoxuǎn xīhóngshì de shíhou, yào xuǎn yánsè jūnyún, bǐjiào yìng de.", "en": "When choosing tomatoes, pick ones with even color that are relatively firm."}]}, {"id": 327, "level": "L11", "chinese": "鸡蛋", "pinyin": "jīdàn", "english": "egg", "khmer": "ស៊ុតមាន់", "breakdown": "鸡(chicken)+蛋(egg)", "ex_cn": "我早上吃鸡蛋。", "ex_py": "Wǒ zǎoshang chī jīdàn.", "ex_en": "I eat eggs in the morning.", "chars": ["鸡", "蛋"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我早上吃鸡蛋。", "py": "Wǒ zǎoshang chī jīdàn.", "en": "I eat eggs in the morning."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "这个鸡蛋很新鲜。", "py": "Zhège jīdàn hěn xīnxiān.", "en": "This egg is very fresh."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "妈妈买了十个鸡蛋。", "py": "Māma mǎile shí ge jīdàn.", "en": "Mom bought ten eggs."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "做这道菜之前，需要先把鸡蛋打散搅拌均匀。", "py": "Zuò zhè dà