ngguórén cóngxiǎo jiù yào xuéhuì de jìnéng.", "en": "Eating with chopsticks is a skill Chinese people learn from childhood."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他第一次用筷子的时候，怎么也夹不起食物。", "py": "Tā dì yī cì yòng kuàizi de shíhou, zěnme yě jiā bu qǐ shíwù.", "en": "The first time he used chopsticks, he couldn't pick up the food no matter what."}]}, {"id": 330, "level": "L11", "chinese": "搅拌", "pinyin": "jiǎobàn", "english": "to stir / to mix", "khmer": "កូរ / លាយ", "breakdown": "搅(stir)+拌(mix)", "ex_cn": "把鸡蛋搅拌一下。", "ex_py": "Bǎ jīdàn jiǎobàn yíxià.", "ex_en": "Stir the eggs a bit.", "chars": ["搅", "拌"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "把鸡蛋搅拌一下。", "py": "Bǎ jīdàn jiǎobàn yíxià.", "en": "Stir the eggs a bit."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "请搅拌一下汤。", "py": "Qǐng jiǎobàn yíxià tāng.", "en": "Please stir the soup a bit."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "她在搅拌面粉。", "py": "Tā zài jiǎobàn miànfěn.", "en": "She is stirring the flour."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "做蛋糕的时候，要把材料充分搅拌均匀才行。", "py": "Zuò dàngāo de shíhou, yào bǎ cáiliào chōngfèn jiǎobàn jūnyún cái xíng.", "en": "When making a cake, you have to thoroughly stir the ingredients evenly."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他一边搅拌咖啡，一边思考接下来该怎么办。", "py": "Tā yìbiān jiǎobàn kāfēi, yìbiān sīkǎo jiē xiàlái gāi zěnme bàn.", "en": "He stirred his coffee while thinking about what to do next."}]}, {"id": 331, "level": "L11", "chinese": "均匀", "pinyin": "jūnyún", "english": "even / uniform", "khmer": "ស្មើគ្នា", "breakdown": "均(equal)+匀(even)", "ex_cn": "把糖搅拌均匀。", "ex_py": "Bǎ táng jiǎobàn jūnyún.", "ex_en": "Stir the sugar until it's even.", "chars": ["均", "匀"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "把糖搅拌均匀。", "py": "Bǎ táng jiǎobàn jūnyún.", "en": "Stir the sugar until it's even."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "涂得很均匀。", "py": "Tú de hěn jūnyún.", "en": "It's spread on evenly."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "颜色要均匀。", "py": "Yánsè yào jūnyún.", "en": "The color needs to be even."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "只有把调料搅拌均匀，做出来的菜才会更美味。", "py": "Zhǐyǒu bǎ tiáoliào jiǎobàn jūnyún, zuò chūlái de cài cái huì gèng měiwèi.", "en": "Only by mixing the seasoning evenly will the dish taste better."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这块布的颜色染得非常均匀，没有一点瑕疵。", "py": "Zhè kuài bù de yánsè rǎn de fēicháng jūnyún, méiyǒu yìdiǎn xiácī.", "en": "This piece of cloth is dyed very evenly, without a single flaw."}]}, {"id": 332, "level": "L11", "chinese": "切", "pinyin": "qiē", "english": "to cut", "khmer": "កាត់", "breakdown": "-", "ex_cn": "妈妈在切西红柿。", "ex_py": "Māma zài qiē xīhóngshì.", "ex_en": "Mom is cutting the tomato.", "chars": ["切"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "妈妈在切西红柿。", "py": "Māma zài qiē xīhóngshì.", "en": "Mom is cutting the tomato."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "请帮我切菜。", "py": "Qǐng bāng wǒ qiē cài.", "en": "Please help me cut vegetables."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他切了一个苹果。", "py": "Tā qiēle yí ge píngguǒ.", "en": "He cut an apple."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "切菜的时候一定要小心，不要伤到手。", "py": "Qiē cài de shíhou yídìng yào xiǎoxīn, búyào shāng dào shǒu.", "en": "You must be careful when cutting vegetables, don't hurt your hand."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他把牛肉切成薄片，方便快速炒熟。", "py": "Tā bǎ niúròu qiē chéng bó piàn, fāngbiàn kuàisù chǎoshú.", "en": "He cut the beef into thin slices, making it easier to stir-fry quickly."}]}, {"id": 333, "level": "L11", "chinese": "块儿", "pinyin": "kuàir", "english": "piece / chunk", "khmer": "ដុំ", "breakdown": "块(chunk)+儿(suffix)", "ex_cn": "把西红柿切成块儿。", "ex_py": "Bǎ xīhóngshì qiē chéng kuàir.", "ex_en": "Cut the tomato into pieces.", "chars": ["块", "儿"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "把西红柿切成块儿。", "py": "Bǎ xīhóngshì qiē chéng kuàir.", "en": "Cut the tomato into pieces."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "这块儿肉很大。", "py": "Zhè kuàir ròu hěn dà.", "en": "This piece of meat is big."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "给我一块儿蛋糕。", "py": "Gěi wǒ yí kuàir dàngāo.", "en": "Give me a piece of cake."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "请把土豆切成大小均匀的块儿，这样容易煮熟。", "py": "Qǐng bǎ tǔdòu qiē chéng dàxiǎo jūnyún de kuàir, zhèyàng róngyì zhǔshú.", "en": "Please cut 