y different cooking methods, each region does it a bit differently."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他改良了传统的做法，让这道菜更符合现代人的口味。", "py": "Tā gǎiliángle chuántǒng de zuòfǎ, ràng zhè dào cài gèng fúhé xiàndàirén de kǒuwèi.", "en": "He improved the traditional method, making this dish better suit modern tastes."}]}, {"id": 352, "level": "L11", "chinese": "开锅", "pinyin": "kāiguō", "english": "to come to a boil", "khmer": "ត្រាំពុះ", "breakdown": "开(open/start)+锅(pot)", "ex_cn": "水开锅以后再放面条。", "ex_py": "Shuǐ kāiguō yǐhòu zài fàng miàntiáo.", "ex_en": "After the water boils, add the noodles.", "chars": ["开", "锅"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "水开锅以后再放面条。", "py": "Shuǐ kāiguō yǐhòu zài fàng miàntiáo.", "en": "After the water boils, add the noodles."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "锅已经开了。", "py": "Guō yǐjīng kāi le.", "en": "The pot is already boiling."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "等水开锅。", "py": "Děng shuǐ kāiguō.", "en": "Wait for the water to boil."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "水开锅以后，要转小火慢慢炖煮，才能保持汤的鲜美。", "py": "Shuǐ kāiguō yǐhòu, yào zhuǎn xiǎohuǒ mànmàn dùnzhǔ, cái néng bǎochí tāng de xiānměi.", "en": "After the water boils, turn to low heat and simmer slowly to keep the soup delicious."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他一直守在炉边，等着锅开好下饺子。", "py": "Tā yìzhí shǒu zài lú biān, děngzhe guō kāi hǎo xià jiǎozi.", "en": "He stayed by the stove, waiting for the pot to boil so he could add the dumplings."}]}, {"id": 353, "level": "L11", "chinese": "迅速", "pinyin": "xùnsù", "english": "quickly / rapid", "khmer": "លឿនរហ័ស", "breakdown": "迅(swift)+速(speed)", "ex_cn": "他迅速地切好了菜。", "ex_py": "Tā xùnsù de qiē hǎole cài.", "ex_en": "He quickly finished cutting the vegetables.", "chars": ["迅", "速"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他迅速地切好了菜。", "py": "Tā xùnsù de qiē hǎole cài.", "en": "He quickly finished cutting the vegetables."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "请迅速离开。", "py": "Qǐng xùnsù líkāi.", "en": "Please leave quickly."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他迅速跑了过去。", "py": "Tā xùnsù pǎole guòqù.", "en": "He qu