 yǒu hěn duō huā.", "en": "There are many flowers in the park."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "孩子们在公园玩。", "py": "Háizimen zài gōngyuán wán.", "en": "The children are playing in the park."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "每天早晨，很多老人都喜欢去公园锻炼身体。", "py": "Měitiān zǎochén, hěn duō lǎorén dōu xǐhuan qù gōngyuán duànliàn shēntǐ.", "en": "Every morning, many elderly people like to go to the park to exercise."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这座公园环境优美，是市民休闲放松的好去处。", "py": "Zhè zuò gōngyuán huánjìng yōuměi, shì shìmín xiūxián fàngsōng de hǎo qùchù.", "en": "This park has a beautiful environment, it's a great place for citizens to relax."}]}, {"id": 383, "level": "L12", "chinese": "下棋", "pinyin": "xiàqí", "english": "to play chess", "khmer": "លេងអុក", "breakdown": "下(play, move a piece)+棋(chess)", "ex_cn": "他喜欢在公园下棋。", "ex_py": "Tā xǐhuan zài gōngyuán xiàqí.", "ex_en": "He likes playing chess in the park.", "chars": ["下", "棋"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他喜欢在公园下棋。", "py": "Tā xǐhuan zài gōngyuán xiàqí.", "en": "He likes playing chess in the park."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "爷爷经常和朋友下棋。", "py": "Yéye jīngcháng hé péngyou xiàqí.", "en": "Grandpa often plays chess with friends."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我们一起下棋吧。", "py": "Wǒmen yìqǐ xiàqí ba.", "en": "Let's play chess together."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他从小就跟爷爷学下棋，现在水平已经很高了。", "py": "Tā cóngxiǎo jiù gēn yéye xué xiàqí, xiànzài shuǐpíng yǐjīng hěn gāo le.", "en": "He's learned chess from his grandpa since childhood, and his level is already quite high now."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "下棋不仅能锻炼思维，还能培养耐心和专注力。", "py": "Xiàqí bùjǐn néng duànliàn sīwéi, hái néng péiyǎng nàixīn hé zhuānzhùlì.", "en": "Playing chess not only trains your thinking, it also builds patience and focus."}]}, {"id": 384, "level": "L12", "chinese": "满意", "pinyin": "mǎnyì", "english": "satisfied", "khmer": "ពេញចិត្ត", "breakdown": "满(full)+意(intention)", "ex_cn": "我对这个房子很满意。", "ex_py": "Wǒ duì zhège fángzi hěn mǎnyì.", "ex_en": "I'm very satisfied with this apartment.", "chars": ["满", "意"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我对这个房子很满意。", "py": "Wǒ duì zhège fángzi hěn mǎnyì.", "en": "I'm very satisfied with this apartment."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他很满意这个结果。", "py": "Tā hěn mǎnyì zhège jiéguǒ.", "en": "He is very satisfied with this result."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "顾客都很满意。", "py": "Gùkè dōu hěn mǎnyì.", "en": "The customers are all satisfied."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "经过这次沟通，双方都对最终的方案感到满意。", "py": "Jīngguò zhè cì gōutōng, shuāngfāng dōu duì zuìzhōng de fāng'àn gǎndào mǎnyì.", "en": "After this discussion, both sides felt satisfied with the final plan."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "老板对他这个月的工作表现非常满意，还表扬了他。", "py": "Lǎobǎn duì tā zhège yuè de gōngzuò biǎoxiàn fēicháng mǎnyì, hái biǎoyángle tā.", "en": "The boss was very satisfied with his work performance this month, and even praised him."}]}, {"id": 385, "level": "L12", "chinese": "认为", "pinyin": "rènwéi", "english": "to think / to believe", "khmer": "គិតថា", "breakdown": "认(recognize)+为(be/act as)", "ex_cn": "我认为这个小区很好。", "ex_py": "Wǒ rènwéi zhège xiǎoqū hěn hǎo.", "ex_en": "I think this community is very good.", "chars": ["认", "为"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我认为这个小区很好。", "py": "Wǒ rènwéi zhège xiǎoqū hěn hǎo.", "en": "I think this community is very good."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我认为他是对的。", "py": "Wǒ rènwéi tā shì duì de.", "en": "I think he is right."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "大家都认为这样很好。", "py": "Dàjiā dōu rènwéi zhèyàng hěn hǎo.", "en": "Everyone thinks this is good."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "很多专家认为，这项政策将对经济产生积极的影响。", "py": "Hěn duō zhuānjiā rènwéi, zhè xiàng zhèngcè jiāng duì jīngjì chǎnshēng jījí de yǐngxiǎng.", "en": "Many experts believe this policy will have a positive effect on the economy."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "尽管有人反对，他仍然认为自己的决定是正确的。", "py": "Jǐnguǎn yǒurén fǎnduì, tā réngrán rènwéi zìjǐ de juédìng shì zhèngquè de.", "en": "Even though some people objected, he still believes his decision is correct."}]}, {"id": 386, "level": "L12", "chinese": "条件", "pinyin": "tiáojiàn", "english": "condition / requirement", "khmer": "លក្ខខណ្ឌ", "breakdown": "条(item)+件(item)", "ex_cn": "这里的条件很不错。", "ex_py": "Zhèlǐ de tiáojiàn hěn búcuò.", "ex_en": "The conditions here are quite good.", "chars": ["条", "件"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "这里的条件很不错。", "py": "Zhèlǐ de tiáojiàn hěn búcuò.", "en": "The conditions here are quite good."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "工作条件很好。", "py": "Gōngzuò tiáojiàn hěn hǎo.", "en": "The working conditions are very good."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我们的条件有限。", "py": "Wǒmen de tiáojiàn yǒuxiàn.", "en": "Our conditions are limited."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这份工作的薪资和福利条件都相当不错，吸引了很多人应聘。", "py": "Zhè fèn gōngzuò de xīnzī hé fúlì tiáojiàn dōu xiāngdāng búcuò, xīyǐnle hěn duō rén yìngpìn.", "en": "This job's salary and benefits are quite good, attracting many applicants."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "只有满足这些条件，才有资格申请这个奖学金。", "py": "Zhǐyǒu mǎnzú zhèxiē tiáojiàn, cái yǒu zīgé shēnqǐng zhège jiǎngxuéjīn.", "en": "Only by meeting these conditions can you be eligible to apply for this scholarship."}]}, {"id": 387, "level": "L12", "chinese": "虽然", "pinyin": "suīrán", "english": "although", "khmer": "ទោះបីជា", "breakdown": "虽(although)+然(so)", "ex_cn": "虽然贵，但是很好。", "ex_py": "Suīrán guì, dànshì hěn hǎo.", "ex_en": "Although it's expensive, it's very good.", "chars": ["虽", "然"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "虽然贵，但是很好。", "py": "Suīrán guì, dànshì hěn hǎo.", "en": "Although it's expensive, it's very good."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "虽然累，但是很开心。", "py": "Suīrán lèi, dànshì hěn kāixīn.", "en": "Although tired, I'm very happy."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "虽然下雨，但是他还是来了。", "py": "Suīrán xiàyǔ, dànshì tā háishi lái le.", "en": "Although it rained, he still came."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "虽然这次考试很难，但是大部分同学还是考出了不错的成绩。", "py": "Suīrán zhè cì kǎoshì hěn nán, dànshì dà bùfen tóngxué háishi kǎo chūle búcuò de chéngjì.", "en": "Although this exam was hard, most students still achieved good grades."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "虽然他年纪不大，但是做事却非常成熟稳重。", "py": "Suīrán tā niánjì bú dà, dànshì zuòshì què fēicháng chéngshú wěnzhòng.", "en": "Although he's not old, he handles things very maturely and steadily."}]}, {"id": 388, "level": "L12", "chinese": "但是", "pinyin": "dànshì", "english": "but / however", "khmer": "ប៉ុន្តែ", "breakdown": "但(but)+是(is)", "ex_cn": "我想去，但是我很忙。", "ex_py": "Wǒ xiǎng qù, dànshì wǒ hěn máng.", "ex_en": "I want to go, but I'm busy.", "chars": ["但", "是"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK1", "cn": "我想去，但是我很忙。", "py": "Wǒ xiǎng qù, dànshì wǒ hěn máng.", "en": "I want to go, but I'm busy."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "他很聪明，但是不努力。", "py": "Tā hěn cōngming, dànshì bù nǔlì.", "en": "He is smart, but doesn't work hard."}, {"level": "HSK1", "cn": "天气很冷，但是他没穿外套。", "py": "Tiānqì hěn lěng, dànshì tā méi chuān wàitào.", "en": "The weather is cold, but he didn't wear a coat."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "这个方法虽然简单，但是效果却非常显著。", "py": "Zhège fāngfǎ suīrán jiǎndān, dànshì xiàoguǒ què fēicháng xiǎnzhù.", "en": "This method is simple, but the effect is very significant."}, {"level": "HSK2", "cn": "他很想帮忙，但是能力有限，只能尽力而为。", "py": "Tā hěn xiǎng bāngmáng, dànshì nénglì yǒuxiàn, zhǐ néng jìnlì ér wéi.", "en": "He really wants to help, but his ability is limited, he can only do his best."}]}, {"id": 389, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "啊", "pinyin": "a", "english": "ah (softening particle at end of sentence)", "khmer": "ណា / អា", "breakdown": "口(mouth)+阿(sound 'a') — a mouth making the sound 'a'", "ex_cn": "好啊！", "ex_py": "Hǎo a!", "ex_en": "Sure, okay!", "chars": ["啊"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "好啊！", "py": "Hǎo a!", "en": "Sure, okay!"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你快点啊。", "py": "Nǐ kuài diǎn a.", "en": "Hurry up, will you."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个菜真好吃啊！", "py": "Zhège cài zhēn hǎochī a!", "en": "This dish is really tasty!"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "是啊，我也这么想。", "py": "Shì a, wǒ yě zhème xiǎng.", "en": "Yeah, I think so too."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你怎么才来啊？", "py": "Nǐ zěnme cái 