ike spring."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "春天的天气很好。", "py": "Chūntiān de tiānqì hěn hǎo.", "en": "The weather in spring is very nice."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "春天花开了。", "py": "Chūntiān huā kāi le.", "en": "Flowers bloom in spring."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "春天以后是夏天。", "py": "Chūntiān yǐhòu shì xiàtiān.", "en": "After spring comes summer."}]}, {"id": 425, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "词典", "pinyin": "cídiǎn", "english": "dictionary", "khmer": "វចនានុក្រម", "breakdown": "词(word)+典(standard book) — a standard book of words", "ex_cn": "这是我的词典。", "ex_py": "Zhè shì wǒ de cídiǎn.", "ex_en": "This is my dictionary.", "chars": ["词", "典"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这是我的词典。", "py": "Zhè shì wǒ de cídiǎn.", "en": "This is my dictionary."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请借我一本词典。", "py": "Qǐng jiè wǒ yì běn cídiǎn.", "en": "Please lend me a dictionary."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我用词典查生词。", "py": "Wǒ yòng cídiǎn chá shēngcí.", "en": "I use a dictionary to look up new words."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这本词典很有用。", "py": "Zhè běn cídiǎn hěn yǒuyòng.", "en": "This dictionary is very useful."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "现在手机上也有词典。", "py": "Xiànzài shǒujī shàng yě yǒu cídiǎn.", "en": "Now there are dictionaries on phones too."}]}, {"id": 426, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "聪明", "pinyin": "cōngming", "english": "clever; smart", "khmer": "ឆ្លាត", "breakdown": "聪(good hearing, 耳ear radical)+明(bright) — sharp ears and a bright mind", "ex_cn": "他很聪明。", "ex_py": "Tā hěn cōngming.", "ex_en": "He is very clever.", "chars": ["聪", "明"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他很聪明。", "py": "Tā hěn cōngming.", "en": "He is very clever."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个孩子真聪明。", "py": "Zhège háizi zhēn cōngming.", "en": "This child is really smart."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "聪明的人也要努力。", "py": "Cōngming de rén yě yào nǔlì.", "en": "Clever people also need to work hard."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你想的这个办法很聪明。", "py": "Nǐ xiǎng de zhège bànfǎ hěn cōngming.", "en": "The method you thought of is very cle