 is of course very important."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你当然应该休息。", "py": "Nǐ dāngrán yīnggāi xiūxi.", "en": "Of course you should rest."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "当然，我会帮你的。", "py": "Dāngrán, wǒ huì bāng nǐ de.", "en": "Of course, I will help you."}]}, {"id": 432, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "地", "pinyin": "de", "english": "-ly (connects an adverb to a verb)", "khmer": "ដោយ (បច្ច័យគុណកិរិយា)", "breakdown": "土(earth)+也(sound yě) — read 'de' as a grammar particle, 'dì' as ground", "ex_cn": "他慢慢地走。", "ex_py": "Tā mànmàn de zǒu.", "ex_en": "He walks slowly.", "chars": ["地"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他慢慢地走。", "py": "Tā mànmàn de zǒu.", "en": "He walks slowly."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请安静地坐下。", "py": "Qǐng ānjìng de zuò xià.", "en": "Please sit down quietly."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "她高兴地笑了。", "py": "Tā gāoxìng de xiào le.", "en": "She smiled happily."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我认真地准备了考试。", "py": "Wǒ rènzhēn de zhǔnbèi le kǎoshì.", "en": "I prepared for the exam seriously."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他快快地吃完了饭。", "py": "Tā kuàikuài de chī wán le fàn.", "en": "He quickly finished the meal."}]}, {"id": 433, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "灯", "pinyin": "dēng", "english": "lamp; light", "khmer": "អំពូល", "breakdown": "火(fire radical)+丁(sound dīng) — fire gives the meaning, 丁 gives the sound", "ex_cn": "请开灯。", "ex_py": "Qǐng kāi dēng.", "ex_en": "Please turn on the light.", "chars": ["灯"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请开灯。", "py": "Qǐng kāi dēng.", "en": "Please turn on the light."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "灯坏了。", "py": "Dēng huài le.", "en": "The light is broken."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "房间里有两个灯。", "py": "Fángjiān lǐ yǒu liǎng ge dēng.", "en": "There are two lights in the room."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "走的时候请关灯。", "py": "Zǒu de shíhou qǐng guān dēng.", "en": "Please turn off the light when you leave."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个灯太亮了。", "py": "Zhège dēng tài liàng le.", "en": "This light is too bright."}]}, {"id": 434, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "地方", "pinyin": "dìfang", "english": "place", "khmer": "កន្លែង", "breakdown": "地(ground, earth)+方(area, direction) — an area of ground", "ex_cn": "这个地方很好。", "ex_py": "Zhège dìfang hěn hǎo.", "ex_en": "This place is very nice.", "chars": ["地", "方"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个地方很好。", "py": "Zhège dìfang hěn hǎo.", "en": "This place is very nice."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你去过什么地方？", "py": "Nǐ qù guo shénme dìfang?", "en": "What places have you been to?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我找不到那个地方。", "py": "Wǒ zhǎo bu dào nàge dìfang.", "en": "I can't find that place."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这里是我最喜欢的地方。", "py": "Zhèlǐ shì wǒ zuì xǐhuan de dìfang.", "en": "This is my favorite place."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "那个地方又安静又干净。", "py": "Nàge dìfang yòu ānjìng yòu gānjìng.", "en": "That place is both quiet and clean."}]}, {"id": 435, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "不但", "pinyin": "búdàn", "english": "not only (usually pairs with 而且)", "khmer": "មិនត្រឹមតែ", "breakdown": "不(not)+但(only) — 'not only'", "ex_cn": "他不但聪明，而且努力。", "ex_py": "Tā búdàn cōngming, érqiě nǔlì.", "ex_en": "He is not only clever, but also hardworking.", "chars": ["不", "但"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他不但聪明，而且努力。", "py": "Tā búdàn cōngming, érqiě nǔlì.", "en": "He is not only clever, but also hardworking."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这里不但干净，而且安静。", "py": "Zhèlǐ búdàn gānjìng, érqiě ānjìng.", "en": "This place is not only clean, but also quiet."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我不但会说汉语，还会写汉字。", "py": "Wǒ búdàn huì shuō Hànyǔ, hái huì xiě Hànzì.", "en": "I can not only speak Chinese, I can also write characters."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他不但迟到了，还忘了带书。", "py": "Tā búdàn chídào le, hái wàng le dài shū.", "en": "He was not only late, he also forgot to bring his book."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个办法不但简单，而且有用。", "py": "Zhège bànfǎ búdàn jiǎndān, érqiě yǒuyòng.", "en": "This method is not only simple, but also useful."}]}, {"id": 436, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "而且", "pinyin": "érqiě", "english": "moreover; and also", "khmer": "ថែមទាំង", "breakdown": "而(and)+且(also) — and also", "ex_cn": "这个菜好吃，而且便宜。", "ex_py": "Zhège cài hǎochī, érqiě piányi.", "ex_en": "This dish is tasty, and also cheap.", "chars": ["而", "且"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个菜好吃，而且便宜。", "py": "Zhège cài hǎochī, érqiě piányi.", "en": "This dish is tasty, and also cheap."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他很忙，而且很累。", "py": "Tā hěn máng, érqiě hěn lèi.", "en": "He is very busy, and also very tired."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "她会说汉语，而且说得很好。", "py": "Tā huì shuō Hànyǔ, érqiě shuō de hěn hǎo.", "en": "She can speak Chinese, and speaks it very well."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这里的东西新鲜，而且不贵。", "py": "Zhèlǐ de dōngxi xīnxiān, érqiě bú guì.", "en": "The things here are fresh, and not expensive."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我认识他，而且我们是同事。", "py": "Wǒ rènshi tā, érqiě wǒmen shì tóngshì.", "en": "I know him, and we are colleagues too."}]}, {"id": 437, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "地铁", "pinyin": "dìtiě", "english": "subway; metro", "khmer": "រថភ្លើងក្រោមដី", "breakdown": "地(ground)+铁(iron) — the iron road under the ground", "ex_cn": "我坐地铁上班。", "ex_py": "Wǒ zuò dìtiě shàngbān.", "ex_en": "I take the subway to work.", "chars": ["地", "铁"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我坐地铁上班。", "py": "Wǒ zuò dìtiě shàngbān.", "en": "I take the subway to work."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "地铁站在哪儿？", "py": "Dìtiě zhàn zài nǎr?", "en": "Where is the subway station?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "坐地铁比坐车快。", "py": "Zuò dìtiě bǐ zuò chē kuài.", "en": "Taking the subway is faster than a car."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "地铁里人很多。", "py": "Dìtiě lǐ rén hěn duō.", "en": "There are many people in the subway."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个城市没有地铁。", "py": "Zhège chéngshì méiyǒu dìtiě.", "en": "This city has no subway."}]}, {"id": 438, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "地图", "pinyin": "dìtú", "english": "map", "khmer": "ផែនទី", "breakdown": "地(ground, land)+图(picture) — a picture of the land", "ex_cn": "请给我一张地图。", "ex_py": "Qǐng gěi wǒ yì 