àngxīn", "english": "to feel relieved; rest assured", "khmer": "ស្ងប់ចិត្ត", "breakdown": "放(put down)+心(heart) — put your heart down", "ex_cn": "你放心吧。", "ex_py": "Nǐ fàngxīn ba.", "ex_en": "Don't worry.", "chars": ["放", "心"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你放心吧。", "py": "Nǐ fàngxīn ba.", "en": "Don't worry."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "妈妈不放心我一个人去。", "py": "Māma bú fàngxīn wǒ yí ge rén qù.", "en": "Mom isn't comfortable with me going alone."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "听到这个消息我就放心了。", "py": "Tīng dào zhège xiāoxi wǒ jiù fàngxīn le.", "en": "Hearing this news I felt relieved."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请放心，我会小心的。", "py": "Qǐng fàngxīn, wǒ huì xiǎoxīn de.", "en": "Rest assured, I will be careful."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他做事我很放心。", "py": "Tā zuò shì wǒ hěn fàngxīn.", "en": "I feel confident about the way he does things."}]}, {"id": 455, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "分", "pinyin": "fēn", "english": "minute; to divide; point (in a score)", "khmer": "នាទី / ចែក", "breakdown": "八(split)+刀(knife) — a knife splitting something", "ex_cn": "现在八点十分。", "ex_py": "Xiànzài bā diǎn shí fēn.", "ex_en": "It's ten past eight now.", "chars": ["分"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "现在八点十分。", "py": "Xiànzài bā diǎn shí fēn.", "en": "It's ten past eight now."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请把蛋糕分一下。", "py": "Qǐng bǎ dàngāo fēn yíxià.", "en": "Please divide the cake."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我考了九十分。", "py": "Wǒ kǎo le jiǔshí fēn.", "en": "I scored ninety points."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我们分成两个班。", "py": "Wǒmen fēn chéng liǎng ge bān.", "en": "We are divided into two classes."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "再等五分钟。", "py": "Zài děng wǔ fēnzhōng.", "en": "Wait five more minutes."}]}, {"id": 456, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "附近", "pinyin": "fùjìn", "english": "nearby; in the vicinity", "khmer": "នៅជិត", "breakdown": "附(attach to)+近(near) — attached and near", "ex_cn": "附近有超市吗？", "ex_py": "Fùjìn yǒu chāoshì ma?", "ex_en": "Is there a supermarket nearby?", "chars": ["附", "近"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "附近有超市吗？", "py": "Fùjìn yǒu chāoshì ma?", "en": "Is there a supermarket nearby?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我家附近很安静。", "py": "Wǒ jiā fùjìn hěn ānjìng.", "en": "It's very quiet near my home."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "学校附近有很多饭店。", "py": "Xuéxiào fùjìn yǒu hěn duō fàndiàn.", "en": "There are many restaurants near the school."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他就住在附近。", "py": "Tā jiù zhù zài fùjìn.", "en": "He lives right nearby."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "附近没有地铁站。", "py": "Fùjìn méiyǒu dìtiě zhàn.", "en": "There is no subway station nearby."}]}, {"id": 457, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "复习", "pinyin": "fùxí", "english": "to review; to revise", "khmer": "ត្រួតពិនិត្យឡើងវិញ", "breakdown": "复(again)+习(practice) — practice again", "ex_cn": "我要复习功课。", "ex_py": "Wǒ yào fùxí gōngkè.", "ex_en": "I need to review my lessons.", "chars": ["复", "习"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我要复习功课。", "py": "Wǒ yào fùxí gōngkè.", "en": "I need to review my lessons."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "考试以前要复习。", "py": "Kǎoshì yǐqián yào fùxí.", "en": "You should review before the exam."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他每天复习一个小时。", "py": "Tā měitiān fùxí yí ge xiǎoshí.", "en": "He reviews for one hour every day."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我们一起复习吧。", "py": "Wǒmen yìqǐ fùxí ba.", "en": "Let's review together."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "复习了以后我就明白了。", "py": "Fùxí le yǐhòu wǒ jiù míngbai le.", "en": "After reviewing I understood."}]}, {"id": 458, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "干净", "pinyin": "gānjìng", "english": "clean; tidy", "khmer": "ស្អាត", "breakdown": "干(dry)+净(clean) — dry and clean", "ex_cn": "房间很干净。", "ex_py": "Fángjiān hěn gānjìng.", "ex_en": "The room is very clean.", "chars": ["干", "净"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "房间很干净。", "py": "Fángjiān hěn gānjìng.", "en": "The room is very clean."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请把手洗干净。", "py": "Qǐng bǎ shǒu xǐ gānjìng.", "en": "Please wash your hands clean."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "打扫以后房间干净多了。", "py": "Dǎsǎo yǐhòu fángjiān gānjìng duō le.", "en": "After cleaning the room is much cleaner."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这家饭店又干净又便宜。", "py": "Zhè jiā fàndiàn yòu gānjìng yòu piányi.", "en": "This restaurant is both clean and cheap."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他吃得很干净。", "py": "Tā chī de hěn gānjìng.", "en": "He ate everything up."}]}, {"id": 459, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "感冒", "pinyin": "gǎnmào", "english": "to catch a cold; a cold", "khmer": "ផ្ដាសាយ", "breakdown": "感(feel)+冒(give off) — the body feeling and giving off illness", "ex_cn": "我感冒了。", "ex_py": "Wǒ gǎnmào le.", "ex_en": "I caught a cold.", "chars": ["感", "冒"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我感冒了。", "py": "Wǒ gǎnmào le.", "en": "I caught a cold."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "天冷容易感冒。", "py": "Tiān lěng róngyì gǎnmào.", "en": "It's easy to catch a cold in cold weather."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "感冒了要多喝水。", "py": "Gǎnmào le yào duō hē shuǐ.", "en": "When you have a cold you should drink more water."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他感冒了，没来上课。", "py": "Tā gǎnmào le, méi lái shàngkè.", "en": "He caught a cold and didn't come to class."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我的感冒好了。", "py": "Wǒ de gǎnmào hǎo le.", "en": "My cold is better."}]}, {"id": 460, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "感兴趣", "pinyin": "gǎn xìngqù", "english": "to be interested in", "khmer": "ចាប់អារម្មណ៍", "breakdown": "感(feel)+兴趣(interest) — to feel interest", "ex_cn": "我对历史感兴趣。", "ex_py": "Wǒ duì lìshǐ gǎn xìngqù.", "ex_en": "I'm interested in history.", "chars": ["感", "兴", "趣"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我对历史感兴趣。", "py": "Wǒ duì lìshǐ gǎn xìngqù.", "en": "I'm interested in history."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他对音乐很感兴趣。", "py": "Tā duì yīnyuè hěn gǎn xìngqù.", "en": "He is very interested in music."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你对什么感兴趣？", "py": "Nǐ duì shénme gǎn xìngqù?", "en": "What are you interested in?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我不太感兴趣。", "py": "Wǒ bú tài gǎn xìngqù.", "en": "I'm not very interested."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "很多人对中文感兴趣。", "py": "Hěn duō rén du