njù tiānqì, míngtiān huì xià yǔ.", "ex_en": "According to the weather, it will rain tomorrow.", "chars": ["根", "据"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "根据天气，明天会下雨。", "py": "Gēnjù tiānqì, míngtiān huì xià yǔ.", "en": "According to the weather, it will rain tomorrow."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "根据老师说的，考试很难。", "py": "Gēnjù lǎoshī shuō de, kǎoshì hěn nán.", "en": "According to what the teacher said, the exam is hard."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你的话没有根据。", "py": "Nǐ de huà méiyǒu gēnjù.", "en": "What you say has no basis."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "根据这张地图，我们走错了。", "py": "Gēnjù zhè zhāng dìtú, wǒmen zǒu cuò le.", "en": "According to this map, we went the wrong way."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "根据成绩来选择。", "py": "Gēnjù chéngjì lái xuǎnzé.", "en": "Choose based on the results."}]}, {"id": 464, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "跟", "pinyin": "gēn", "english": "with; to follow", "khmer": "ជាមួយ / តាម", "breakdown": "足(foot radical)+艮 — the foot radical shows following on foot", "ex_cn": "我跟他一起去。", "ex_py": "Wǒ gēn tā yìqǐ qù.", "ex_en": "I'll go together with him.", "chars": ["跟"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我跟他一起去。", "py": "Wǒ gēn tā yìqǐ qù.", "en": "I'll go together with him."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请跟我来。", "py": "Qǐng gēn wǒ lái.", "en": "Please follow me."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你跟谁说话？", "py": "Nǐ gēn shéi shuōhuà?", "en": "Who are you talking with?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个跟那个一样。", "py": "Zhège gēn nàge yíyàng.", "en": "This one is the same as that one."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "孩子跟着妈妈走。", "py": "Háizi gēnzhe māma zǒu.", "en": "The child walks following mom."}]}, {"id": 465, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "更", "pinyin": "gèng", "english": "even more", "khmer": "កាន់តែ", "breakdown": "Whole shape — read gèng for 'even more'", "ex_cn": "今天更冷。", "ex_py": "Jīntiān gèng lěng.", "ex_en": "Today is even colder.", "chars": ["更"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "今天更冷。", "py": "Jīntiān gèng lěng.", "en": "Today is even colder."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他比我更努力。", "py": "Tā bǐ wǒ gèng nǔlì.", "en": "He works even harder than me."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个办法更简单。", "py": "Zhège bànfǎ gèng jiǎndān.", "en": "This method is even simpler."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "复习以后我更明白了。", "py": "Fùxí yǐhòu wǒ gèng míngbai le.", "en": "After reviewing I understand even better."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我更喜欢喝茶。", "py": "Wǒ gèng xǐhuan hē chá.", "en": "I like drinking tea even more."}]}, {"id": 466, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "公斤", "pinyin": "gōngjīn", "english": "kilogram", "khmer": "គីឡូក្រាម", "breakdown": "公(public, metric)+斤(a Chinese weight unit) — the metric version of 斤", "ex_cn": "我买了两公斤水果。", "ex_py": "Wǒ mǎi le liǎng gōngjīn shuǐguǒ.", "ex_en": "I bought two kilograms of fruit.", "chars": ["公", "斤"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我买了两公斤水果。", "py": "Wǒ mǎi le liǎng gōngjīn shuǐguǒ.", "en": "I bought two kilograms of fruit."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个箱子有十公斤。", "py": "Zhège xiāngzi yǒu shí gōngjīn.", "en": "This box weighs ten kilograms."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你有多少公斤？", "py": "Nǐ yǒu duōshao gōngjīn?", "en": "How many kilograms do you weigh?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "一公斤米多少钱？", "py": "Yì gōngjīn mǐ duōshao qián?", "en": "How much is one kilogram of rice?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他瘦了三公斤。", "py": "Tā shòu le sān gōngjīn.", "en": "He lost three kilograms."}]}, {"id": 467, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "故事", "pinyin": "gùshi", "english": "story; tale", "khmer": "រឿង", "breakdown": "故(old, past)+事(matter) — a matter from the past", "ex_cn": "我喜欢听故事。", "ex_py": "Wǒ xǐhuan tīng gùshi.", "ex_en": "I like listening to stories.", "chars": ["故", "事"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我喜欢听故事。", "py": "Wǒ xǐhuan tīng gùshi.", "en": "I like listening to stories."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个故事很有意思。", "py": "Zhège gùshi hěn yǒu yìsi.", "en": "This story is very interesting."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "妈妈给我讲故事。", "py": "Māma gěi wǒ jiǎng gùshi.", "en": "Mom tells me stories."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这本书里有很多故事。", "py": "Zhè běn shū lǐ yǒu hěn duō gùshi.", "en": "There are many stories in this book."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "故事的最后他回家了。", "py": "Gùshi de zuìhòu tā huí jiā le.", "en": "At the end of the story he went home."}]}, {"id": 468, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "刮风", "pinyin": "guāfēng", "english": "to be windy; the wind blows", "khmer": "ខ្យល់បក់", "breakdown": "刮(scrape, 刂knife radical)+风(wind) — wind scraping past", "ex_cn": "今天刮风了。", "ex_py": "Jīntiān guāfēng le.", "ex_en": "It's windy today.", "chars": ["刮", "风"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "今天刮风了。", "py": "Jīntiān guāfēng le.", "en": "It's windy today."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "外面刮大风。", "py": "Wàimiàn guā dà fēng.", "en": "There's a strong wind outside."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "刮风的时候别出去。", "py": "Guāfēng de shíhou bié chūqù.", "en": "Don't go out when it's windy."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "昨天又刮风又下雨。", "py": "Zuótiān yòu guāfēng yòu xià yǔ.", "en": "Yesterday it was both windy and rainy."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "秋天常常刮风。", "py": "Qiūtiān chángcháng guāfēng.", "en": "It's often windy in autumn."}]}, {"id": 469, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "关", "pinyin": "guān", "english": "to close; to turn off", "khmer": "បិទ", "breakdown": "Whole shape — think of a gate being shut", "ex_cn": "请关门。", "ex_py": "Qǐng guān mén.", "ex_en": "Please close the door.", "chars": ["关"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请关门。", "py": "Qǐng guān mén.", "en": "Please close the door."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "走的时候关灯。", "py": "Zǒu de shíhou guān dēng.", "en": "Turn off the light when you leave."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "超市几点关门？", "py": "Chāoshì jǐ diǎn guān mén?", "en": "What time does the supermarket close?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请把电视关了。", "py": "Qǐng bǎ diànshì guān le.", "en": "Please turn off the TV."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "窗户没关好。", "py": "Chuānghu méi guān hǎo.", "en": "The window isn't closed properly."}]}, {"id": 470, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "关系", "pinyin": "guānxi", "english": "relationship; connection", "khmer": "ទំនាក់ទំនង", "breakdown": "关(connect, close)+系(tie together) — things tied together", "ex_cn": "他们的关系很好。", "ex_py": "Tāmen de guānxi hěn hǎo.", "ex_en": "Their relationship is very good.", "chars": ["关", "系"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他们的关系很好。", "py": "Tāmen de guānxi hěn hǎo.", "en": "Their relationship is very good."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "没关系。", "py": "Méi guānxi.", "en": "It doesn't matter."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这两件事没有关系。", "py": "Zhè liǎng jiàn shì méiyǒu guānxi.", "en": "These two things are unrelated."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我跟他关系一般。", "py": "Wǒ gēn tā guānxi yìbān.", "en": "My relationship with him is ordinary."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这跟你有关系吗？", "py": "Zhè gēn nǐ yǒu guānxi ma?", "en": "Does this have anything to do with you?"}]}, {"id": 471, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "关心", "pinyin": "guānxīn", "english": "to care about; be concerned about", "khmer": "យកចិត្តទុកដាក់", "breakdown": "关(connect)+心(heart) — your heart is connected to it", "ex_cn": "谢谢你的关心。", "ex_py": "Xièxie nǐ de guānxīn.", "ex_en": "Thank you for your concern.", "chars": ["关", "心"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "谢谢你的关心。", "py": "Xièxie nǐ de guānxīn.", "en": "Thank you for your concern."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "父母很关心孩子。", "py": "Fùmǔ hěn guānxīn háizi.", "en": "Parents care a lot about their children."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他很关心同事。", "py": "Tā hěn guānxīn tóngshì.", "en": "He cares about his colleagues."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我们要关心身体健康。", "py": "Wǒmen yào guānxīn shēntǐ jiànkāng.", "en": "We should care about our health."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "没有人关心这件事。", "py": "Méiyǒu rén guānxīn zhè jiàn shì.", "en": "Nobody cares about this matter."}]}, {"id": 472, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "关于", "pinyin": "guānyú", "english": "about; regarding", "khmer": "អំពី", "breakdown": "关(connect)+于(at, to) — connected to a topic", "ex_cn": "这是关于历史的书。", "ex_py": "Zhè shì guānyú lìshǐ de shū.", "ex_en": "This is a book about history.", "chars": ["关", "于"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这是关于历史的书。", "py": "Zhè shì guānyú lìshǐ de shū.", "en": "This is a book about history."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "关于这件事，我不知道。", "py": "Guānyú zhè jiàn shì, wǒ bù zhīdào.", "en": "Regarding this matter, I don't know."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他讲了关于中国文化的事。", "py": "Tā jiǎng le guānyú Zhōngguó wénhuà de shì.", "en": "He talked about Chinese culture."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "关于考试的问题请问老师。", "py": "Guānyú kǎoshì de wèntí qǐng wèn lǎoshī.", "en": "For questions about the exam please ask the teacher."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我看了一个关于动物的节目。", "py": "Wǒ kàn le yí ge guānyú dòngwù de jiémù.", "en": "I watched a program about animals."}]}, {"id": 473, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "国家", "pinyin": "guójiā", "english": "country; nation", "khmer": "ប្រទេស", "breakdown": "国(country)+家(home) — the country is the big home", "ex_cn": "中国是一个大国家。", "ex_py": "Zhōngguó shì yí ge dà guójiā.", "ex_en": "China is a big country.", "chars": ["国", "家"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "中国是一个大国家。", "py": "Zhōngguó shì yí ge dà guójiā.", "en": "China is a big country."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你是哪个国家的人？", "py": "Nǐ shì nǎge guójiā de rén?", "en": "Which country are you from?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我去过三个国家。", "py": "Wǒ qù guo sān ge guójiā.", "en": "I have been to three countries."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "每个国家的文化都不一样。", "py": "Měi ge guójiā de wénhuà dōu bù yíyàng.", "en": "Every country's culture is different."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这个国家很小，可是很干净。", "py": "Zhège guójiā hěn xiǎo, kěshì hěn gānjìng.", "en": "This country is small, but very clean."}]}, {"id": 474, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "过去", "pinyin": "guòqù", "english": "in the past; to go over", "khmer": "អតីតកាល", "breakdown": "过(pass)+去(go) — time that has gone past", "ex_cn": "过去我住在北京。", "ex_py": "Guòqù wǒ zhù zài Běijīng.", "ex_en": "In the past I lived in Beijing.", "chars": ["过", "去"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "过去我住在北京。", "py": "Guòqù wǒ zhù zài Běijīng.", "en": "In the past I lived in Beijing."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "过去的事就别想了。", "py": "Guòqù de shì jiù bié xiǎng le.", "en": "Don't think about the past."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我走过去看看。", "py": "Wǒ zǒu guòqù kànkan.", "en": "I'll walk over and take a look."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "过去这里没有地铁。", "py": "Guòqù zhèlǐ méiyǒu dìtiě.", "en": "In the past there was no subway here."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "过去两年他变化很大。", "py": "Guòqù liǎng nián tā biànhuà hěn dà.", "en": "He has changed a lot in the past two years."}]}, {"id": 475, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "还是", "pinyin": "háishi", "english": "or (in questions); still; had better", "khmer": "ឬ / នៅតែ", "breakdown": "还(still)+是(be) — still is; also used for 'or'", "ex_cn": "你喝茶还是喝水？", "ex_py": "Nǐ hē chá háishi hē shuǐ?", "ex_en": "Do you drink tea or water?", "chars": ["还", "是"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你喝茶还是喝水？", "py": "Nǐ hē chá háishi hē shuǐ?", "en": "Do you drink tea or water?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我们还是走吧。", "py": "Wǒmen háishi zǒu ba.", "en": "We'd better go."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他还是没来。", "py": "Tā háishi méi lái.", "en": "He still hasn't come."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "你去还是我去？", "py": "Nǐ qù háishi wǒ qù?", "en": "Are you going or am I?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "外面下雨，还是别出去了。", "py": "Wàimiàn xià yǔ, háishi bié chūqù le.", "en": "It's raining outside, better not go out."}]}, {"id": 476, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "害怕", "pinyin": "hàipà", "english": "to be afraid; to fear", "khmer": "ខ្លាច", "breakdown": "害(harm)+怕(fear, 忄heart radical) — the heart fearing harm", "ex_cn": "我很害怕。", "ex_py": "Wǒ hěn hàipà.", "ex_en": "I'm very scared.", "chars": ["害", "怕"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我很害怕。", "py": "Wǒ hěn hàipà.", "en": "I'm very scared."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "别害怕，我在这儿。", "py": "Bié hàipà, wǒ zài zhèr.", "en": "Don't be afraid, I'm here."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他害怕考试。", "py": "Tā hàipà kǎoshì.", "en": "He is afraid of exams."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "孩子害怕黑。", "py": "Háizi hàipà hēi.", "en": "The child is afraid of the dark."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我害怕说错话。", "py": "Wǒ hàipà shuō cuò huà.", "en": "I'm afraid of saying the wrong thing."}]}, {"id": 477, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "黑板", "pinyin": "hēibǎn", "english": "blackboard", "khmer": "ក្ដារខៀន", "breakdown": "黑(black)+板(board) — a black board", "ex_cn": "老师在黑板上写字。", "ex_py": "Lǎoshī zài hēibǎn shàng xiě zì.", "ex_en": "The teacher writes on the blackboard.", "chars": ["黑", "板"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "老师在黑板上写字。", "py": "Lǎoshī zài hēibǎn shàng xiě zì.", "en": "The teacher writes on the blackboard."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请看黑板。", "py": "Qǐng kàn hēibǎn.", "en": "Please look at the blackboard."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "黑板上有很多汉字。", "py": "Hēibǎn shàng yǒu hěn duō Hànzì.", "en": "There are many characters on the blackboard."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "谁能擦一下黑板？", "py": "Shéi néng cā yíxià hēibǎn?", "en": "Can someone wipe the blackboard?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我坐得远，看不清楚黑板。", "py": "Wǒ zuò de yuǎn, kàn bu qīngchu hēibǎn.", "en": "I sit far away and can't see the blackboard clearly."}]}, {"id": 478, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "后来", "pinyin": "hòulái", "english": "afterwards; later", "khmer": "ក្រោយមក", "breakdown": "后(after)+来(come) — what came after", "ex_cn": "后来他就走了。", "ex_py": "Hòulái tā jiù zǒu le.", "ex_en": "Afterwards he left.", "chars": ["后", "来"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "后来他就走了。", "py": "Hòulái tā jiù zǒu le.", "en": "Afterwards he left."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "后来发生了什么？", "py": "Hòulái fāshēng le shénme?", "en": "What happened afterwards?"}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "后来我们成了好朋友。", "py": "Hòulái wǒmen chéng le hǎo péngyou.", "en": "Later we became good friends."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我先去了学校，后来去了图书馆。", "py": "Wǒ xiān qù le xuéxiào, hòulái qù le túshūguǎn.", "en": "I first went to school, then later to the library."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "后来的事我不清楚。", "py": "Hòulái de shì wǒ bù qīngchu.", "en": "I'm not clear about what happened later."}]}, {"id": 479, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "护照", "pinyin": "hùzhào", "english": "passport", "khmer": "លិខិតឆ្លងដែន", "breakdown": "护(protect)+照(certificate) — a document that protects you abroad", "ex_cn": "请给我看你的护照。", "ex_py": "Qǐng gěi wǒ kàn nǐ de hùzhào.", "ex_en": "Please show me your passport.", "chars": ["护", "照"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "请给我看你的护照。", "py": "Qǐng gěi wǒ kàn nǐ de hùzhào.", "en": "Please show me your passport."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我的护照丢了。", "py": "Wǒ de hùzhào diū le.", "en": "I lost my passport."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "出国要带护照。", "py": "Chū guó yào dài hùzhào.", "en": "You need to bring a passport to go abroad."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "护照在我的包里。", "py": "Hùzhào zài wǒ de bāo lǐ.", "en": "The passport is in my bag."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "办护照要多长时间？", "py": "Bàn hùzhào yào duō cháng shíjiān?", "en": "How long does it take to get a passport?"}]}, {"id": 480, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "花", "pinyin": "huā", "english": "flower; to spend (money or time)", "khmer": "ផ្កា / ចំណាយ", "breakdown": "艹(grass radical)+化(sound huà) — plant radical plus the 'hua' sound", "ex_cn": "这些花很好看。", "ex_py": "Zhèxiē huā hěn hǎokàn.", "ex_en": "These flowers are very pretty.", "chars": ["花"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这些花很好看。", "py": "Zhèxiē huā hěn hǎokàn.", "en": "These flowers are very pretty."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "春天花开了。", "py": "Chūntiān huā kāi le.", "en": "Flowers bloom in spring."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我花了很多钱。", "py": "Wǒ huā le hěn duō qián.", "en": "I spent a lot of money."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这件事花了我三天。", "py": "Zhè jiàn shì huā le wǒ sān tiān.", "en": "This took me three days."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他买了一些花送给妈妈。", "py": "Tā mǎi le yìxiē huā sòng gěi māma.", "en": "He bought some flowers for his mom."}]}, {"id": 481, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "画", "pinyin": "huà", "english": "to draw; a painting", "khmer": "គូរ / រូបគំនូរ", "breakdown": "Whole shape — a ha