hé hěn cháng.", "en": "The Yellow River is very long."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我想去看黄河。", "py": "Wǒ xiǎng qù kàn Huánghé.", "en": "I want to go see the Yellow River."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "黄河在中国的北方。", "py": "Huánghé zài Zhōngguó de běifāng.", "en": "The Yellow River is in northern China."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "关于黄河有很多故事。", "py": "Guānyú Huánghé yǒu hěn duō gùshi.", "en": "There are many stories about the Yellow River."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "黄河对中国历史很重要。", "py": "Huánghé duì Zhōngguó lìshǐ hěn zhòngyào.", "en": "The Yellow River is very important to Chinese history."}]}, {"id": 484, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "几乎", "pinyin": "jīhū", "english": "almost; nearly", "khmer": "ស្ទើរតែ", "breakdown": "几(how many, a few)+乎(particle) — down to just a few, so 'almost'", "ex_cn": "我几乎迟到了。", "ex_py": "Wǒ jīhū chídào le.", "ex_en": "I almost arrived late.", "chars": ["几", "乎"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我几乎迟到了。", "py": "Wǒ jīhū chídào le.", "en": "I almost arrived late."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "他几乎每天都锻炼。", "py": "Tā jīhū měitiān dōu duànliàn.", "en": "He exercises almost every day."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这本书我几乎看完了。", "py": "Zhè běn shū wǒ jīhū kàn wán le.", "en": "I have almost finished this book."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "教室里几乎没有人。", "py": "Jiàoshì lǐ jīhū méiyǒu rén.", "en": "There is almost nobody in the classroom."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我几乎忘记这件事了。", "py": "Wǒ jīhū wàngjì zhè jiàn shì le.", "en": "I almost forgot about this."}]}, {"id": 485, "level": "HSK3", "chinese": "机会", "pinyin": "jīhuì", "english": "opportunity; chance", "khmer": "ឱកាស", "breakdown": "机(machine, chance)+会(meeting) — a moment that comes together", "ex_cn": "这是一个好机会。", "ex_py": "Zhè shì yí ge hǎo jīhuì.", "ex_en": "This is a good opportunity.", "chars": ["机", "会"], "examples": [{"level": "HSK3", "cn": "这是一个好机会。", "py": "Zhè shì yí ge hǎo jīhuì.", "en": "This is a good opportunity."}, {"level": "HSK3", "cn": "我没有机会去。", "py": "Wǒ méiyǒu jīhuì qù.", "en": "I have no